B.aQB=new A.cF("what-can-i-do","Where is everything I can do with a song?","Open the song and press What can I do, beside its menu at the top. It lists everything you can do to that song: practise it, record on it, read it your way, ask the room, put it up on a call, send it to a student, put it on the Open Mic, print it, or send the words by text or email.\n\nSomething you cannot do yet stays on the list, with the reason and, when there is one, the way to change it: a song with no recording says there is nothing to slow yet, with Add one beside it.\n\nTalk it over opens the room's conversation about the song, Tell somebody sends a note about it to the people you pick, and Say who wrote it is where a song is marked as yours, public domain or somebody else's. Printing and sending the words are in the song's menu as well, as Send to printer and Share by text or email.",B.c1h)
